    <div class="subtab-panel" data-subpanel="profile-team-cores" hidden>
      <p class="sub">
        Which Pokémon most often share a team with this Pokémon.
        <strong>Co-occurrence</strong> is the raw pairing rate, which mostly
        re-ranks whoever is individually popular; <strong>synergy</strong>
        ranks by lift — how much more often the pair appears together than
        their individual popularity alone predicts (&times;1.0 is exactly
        chance). Synergy is restricted to pairs seen on at least 5 real teams,
        since lift is noisy below that.
      </p>
      <div class="controls">
        <label>Core size
