  <section class="tab-panel" data-panel="matchup" hidden>
    <h2>Matchup</h2>
    <p class="sub">
      Real head-to-head records, type effectiveness, teammate co-usage, and a
      stats/setup/weather-aware damage calculator — see
      docs/design-system.md's "Matchup tab" for what this does and doesn't
      model. Head-to-head is measured <strong>team vs team</strong>: no source
      publishes which Pokémon were actually brought to a given match.
    </p>
    <div class="matchup-picker-grid">
      <div class="matchup-side">
        <h4>Attacker</h4>
        <label>Pokémon <select id="matchup-attacker-select"></select></label>
